@startuml
!include skin.iuml
hide empty description
state "Main Window" as Main : choose file, formats and options
state "Preview Tab" as Prev : Features, Background and Scenarios
state "Error Report Tab" as Err : one row per invalid requirement
state "Normalization Dialog" as Norm : original vs. normalized text\naccept / reject
state "Overwrite Dialog" as Ovr : overwrite existing file? yes / no
state "Export Result Dialog" as Res : list of written files
[*] --> Main
Main --> Norm : Generate [free text, LLM on]
Norm --> Norm : next free-text requirement
Norm --> Prev : all answered
Main --> Prev : Generate
Prev --> Err : open tab [invalid > 0]
Err --> Prev : open tab
Prev --> Ovr : Export [file exists]
Ovr --> Res : answered
Prev --> Res : Export
Res --> Main : Close
@enduml
